{
  "id": "mesoten",
  "name": "Mesoten",
  "date": "29 September – 1 October 1812",
  "campaign": "russia-1812",
  "summary": "Reinforced by Steinheil's corps from Finland, the Russians came out of Riga in strength and pushed the Prussians back across Courland. Yorck turned on them: in three days of fighting along the Aa, at Mesoten, Gräfenthal, Lautschkrug and the Garosse, the Prussians threw the Finland Corps back with heavy losses in prisoners, and Steinheil withdrew to Riga.",
